title: Reformist leaders resign
new-page: true 
subtitle: Reformist disagreements with our policies have grown too severe.
tags: event
view-if: not reformists_resign and ((spd_centrist and reformist_dissent >= 70) or (not spd_centrist and reformist_dissent >= 60))
on-arrival: reformist_strength *= 0.3; workers_spd -= 10; workers_others += 5; n_advisors -= 1 if braun_advisor == 1; n_advisors -= 1 if severing_advisor == 1; braun_advisor = 0; severing_advisor = 0; rb_strength -= 250; reformists_resign = 1

= Reformist leaders resign

Our policy choices have greatly offended the reformist faction. Many of our most experienced leaders have resigned.
